        "Added definition and scope notes for Canvas."@en ;
    skos:definition "A core plugin that enables you to arrange and connect notes on an infinite canvas."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/pkm/vocab> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Canvas"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "- Used for visualizing and organizing related notes with their relationships."@en .

