        "2026-08-29 — Scope note updated (by Doug Warren)"@en,
        "Added definiton and scope notes for Effort Log."@en ;
    skos:definition "A chronological record of what actually happened during an effort."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/pkm/vocab> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Effort Log"@en ;
