    skos:changeNote "2026-08-29 — Definition updated (by Doug Warren)"@en,
        "2026-08-29 — Duplicated from “Topic Index” (by Doug Warren)"@en,
        "2026-08-29 — Renamed from “TopicIndexCopy” to “TopicReview”; Preferred label changed from “Topic Index@en” to “Topic Review@en”; Scope note updated (by Doug Warren)"@en,
        "Added definiton and scope notes for a Topic Index."@en ;
    skos:definition "A structured retrospective evaluating a topic."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/pkm/vocab> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Topic Review"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote """- Output of the Topic Review workflow: assesses the actual Topic Log against the Topic Plan intentions.
- Includes Plus-Minus-Next (PMN) analysis by Claude AI: what worked, what needs improving, and what's next."""@en .

