pkmv:PKMStudio a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "PKM Studio"@en ;
    dcterms:created "2026-08-29"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:creator pkma:Doug-Warren ;
    dcterms:issued "2026-08-15"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:modified "2026-08-29"^^xsd:date ;
    isothes:broaderPartitive pkmv:PKMSwift ;
    skos:broader pkmv:PKMSwift ;
    skos:changeNote "2026-08-29 — Duplicated from “PKM Meals” (by Doug Warren)"@en,
        "2026-08-29 — Parent “PKM Swift” added (by Doug Warren)"@en,
        "2026-08-29 — Renamed from “PKMMealsCopy” to “PKMStudio”; Preferred label changed from “PKM Meals@en” to “PKM Studio@en”; Definition updated; Scope note updated (by Doug Warren)"@en,
        "2026-08-29 — Unmarked as a top concept (by Doug Warren)"@en,
        "Added definition and scope notes for PKM Studio."@en,
        "Removed as Top Concept and moved under PKM Swift."@en ;
    skos:definition "A SwiftUI app that manages a PKM knowledge system."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/pkm/vocab> ;
    skos:prefLabel "PKM Studio"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote """- Available on macOS, iOS, iPadOS, and watchOS.
- Uses Python and Swift services, scripts, commands, and agents.
- Integrates with Obsidian notes, Neo4j graph database, Claude AI LLM, and diabetes websites.
- Provides functions via the App Intents framework to offer actions for use in Shortcuts (workflows), Siri AI (voice interface & natural language), or Spotlight (search).
- Supports development and management of concepts, glossary, taxonomy, thesaurus, ontology, knowledge graph, schema, metadata, and associated development artifacts."""@en .

